text IndigoPlateau_PokemonCenter_1F_Text_GymGuyAdvice {
    "Yo!\n"
    "Champ in the making!\p"
    "At the Pokémon League, you will\n"
    "face the Elite Four all in a row.\p"
    "If you lose, you have to start all\n"
    "over again!\p"
    "This is it!\n"
    "Go for it!$"
}

text IndigoPlateau_PokemonCenter_1F_Text_FaceEliteFourGoodLuck {
    "From here on, you face the\n"
    "Elite Four one by one.\p"
    "If you win, a door opens to the\n"
    "next Trainer. Good luck!$"
}

text IndigoPlateau_PokemonCenter_1F_Text_LoreleiIsAbsentClosedForTimeBeing {
    "I am so sorry, but you've wasted\n"
    "your time coming here.\p"
    "Lorelei of the Elite Four is\n"
    "absent, you see.\p"
    "As a result, the Pokémon League is\n"
    "closed for the time being.$"
}

text IndigoPlateau_PokemonCenter_1F_Text_AgathaWhuppedUs {
    "Agatha's Ghost-type Pokémon are\n"
    "horrifically terrifying in toughness.\p"
    "I took my Fighting-type Pokémon\n"
    "and raised them to the max.\p"
    "I went at Agatha feeling pretty\n"
    "confident, but she whupped us.\p"
    "That old lady's also got a really\n"
    "short fuse, too.\p"
    "It doesn't take anything to get\n"
    "that scary lady hollering.$"
}

text IndigoPlateau_PokemonCenter_1F_Text_LancesCousinGymLeaderFarAway {
    "Maybe becoming an Elite Four\n"
    "member is in the blood.\p"
    "From what I've heard, Lance has\n"
    "a cousin who's a Gym Leader\l"
    "somewhere far away.$"
}
